        <title>Mosdns搭配OC的流量分流</title>
        <link rel="alternate" href="https://xubiaolin.github.io/2025/09/27/huan-jing-wen-ti/mosdns-da-pei-oc-de-liu-liang-fen-liu/"/>
        <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;1、打开mosdns的设置，点启用，勾选dns转发接管dnsmaq，不用自定义国内，用wan口获得的运营商dns就行&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/5030c46b3dc3cb4d5fb4439bc2c3a778b338fce781b78c58792cb58ec94351b9.png&#34; alt=&#34;picture 3&#34;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2、mosdns高级选项，服务器数量改2或以上，勾选防泄露和启用缓存，有需要可以加个广告过滤的订阅&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/15c6b96f1234bdba86c7e302c74153525694dca8796163dbb9f52022c002f12e.png&#34; alt=&#34;picture 4&#34;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3、OC的设置，只能在redir-host模式走分流&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/b9ac2d6ade0b8cff17017b68ece4aaa8ec93a5ac60ac109fa2539862b10a06de.png&#34; alt=&#34;picture 5&#34;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4、绕过本机、代理常用端口、绕过大地&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/0f7918aa9022a05349419426598172abb0f26c0b7e01bf8468ffa1bb82f79770.png&#34; alt=&#34;picture 11&#34;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5、禁用本地，把dns交给mosdns接管&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/2d7bebda40dd65c972fb69eaf7071b1837f928d58c958106dbd53281787aa7e8.png&#34; alt=&#34;picture 12&#34;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6、勾选自定义上游和遵循，然后nameserver和fallback组只保留两组地址和端口，地址都填127.0.0.1，端口都是mosdns的5335，类型分别选udp和tcp，然后保存并应用&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/refs/heads/master/26c617cf79ef29d8b35b673585d055e3dfce69d80d939fa8db99070e23a0cea5.png&#34; alt=&#34;picture 13&#34;&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;最后就能得到一个比较畅快又干净的网络环境了！！！！！&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://ghproxy.imoyuapp.win/https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xubiaolin/picgo/master/202509271853553.png&#34; alt=&#34;picture 14&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
